{"version":1,"content":"<p>參演熱播中的特攝劇《超人狄奧》的23歲日本女星中田乃愛，驚爆日前離世。</p><p>其所屬事務所東寶藝能今日(16日)發聲明，透露中田乃愛於日前離世，終年23歲，未有交代死因，並根據其家屬意向，葬禮已低調舉行。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.255701+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:37:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:24.990611+00:00","content_hash":"2ec98a3d888e4f1368c27d7b58d911e3b5f4b0665dfcb01eac89a9638333e165","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}